‘Massacre of innocents’: 14 Yemenis killed in 101 Saudi strikes in 24 hours 

More than a dozen civilians have been killed and several more sustained injuries as Saudi Arabia carried out at least 101 airstrikes and missile attacks against Yemen within a span of 24 hours, bringing the total number of Saudi airstrikes and missile attacks since July to 3,480.

